Mon Nov 16 20:33:34 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 0.1.3:
  * config: add opt_in_tools option to select exposed tools
  * resources_create_or_update: support namespace parameter
    (like kubectl apply -n namespace)
  * Helm: set nodePort value when service type is NodePort
  * telemetry: respect OTEL_SERVICE_NAME via telemetry.service_name
  * HTTP metrics: label requests by route instead of raw path
  * netobserv: add target compatibility filtering
  * core: return structured Status on resource tool errors
  * kiali: honor require_tls for in-cluster discovery candidates
  * kubevirt: drop deprecated spec.running when setting runStrategy

