- Stamp the version into the binary (reported 0.0.0)
- Drop CGO_ENABLED=0: link against glibc, with full RELRO
- Require go >= 1.26.10, the go.mod floor
- Fetch Source0 via download_files, vendor via go_modules
- %check skips pkg/mcp (its envtest downloads kube-apiserver and
  etcd) and TestHasKiali_DiscoverFromCR (needs real DNS)

